			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 26, DX 10, IQ 6, HT 12, HP 26, WILL 10, PER 11, FP 12, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 7, DODGE 8, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
